      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear how broken your identity feels when the external label of success suddenly crumbles, and it is completely understandable why you wish to escape the humiliation of a downward spiral. While the desire for dignity is profound, choosing to stop before the bottom is often an act of self-preservation rather than an acceptance of defeat, so please consider that survival does not require continuous relapse. You are deeply loved by your parents despite this failure, and reaching out to a mental health professional can help you rebuild a sense of self that exists beyond your business. You deserve kindness and help, even if you cannot find it within your current state of despair.",
